flowchart TD

    Login([User opens app and logs in]) --> Auth{Is user authenticated?}

    Auth -->|No| Denied[Access denied: show login error]
    Denied --> Login

    Auth -->|Yes| AdminCheck{Is user a site admin?}

    AdminCheck -->|No| OrgCheck{Does user already belong to an organisation?}
    OrgCheck -->|No| CreateOrg[Create organisation]
    CreateOrg --> BecomeOwner[User becomes organisation owner]
    BecomeOwner --> OwnerManagementPage

    OrgCheck -->|No: browse existing| OrgList[Organisation list page]
    OrgList --> OrgDetail[Organisation detail page]
    OrgDetail --> AskMembership[User asks to become a member]
    AskMembership --> MembershipRequest[Membership request waits for owner approval]
    MembershipRequest --> Pending[Pending invitation: wait for owner decision]
    MembershipRequest -->|Visible only to owner| OwnerManagementPage

    OrgCheck -->|Yes: already member of specific organisation| ApprovedUser[Approved organisation user]

    OwnerManagementPage -->|Owner adds or invites member by email| DirectMember[Invited user accepts membership]
    Pending --> NoAccess[No organisation building access yet]

    ApprovedUser --> UserPage[User management and projects access]
    UserPage --> UserCreate[Can create buildings]
    UserPage --> UserEditOwn[Can edit only own buildings]
    UserPage --> UserNoEditOthers[Cannot edit buildings created by other users]

    OrgCheck -->|Yes: organisation owner| OwnerManagementPage[Owner organisation area / user management page<br/>Can manage organisation users<br/>Can invite member by email]
    OwnerManagementPage -->|Owner reviews pending requests| OwnerDecision{Approve invitation?}
    OwnerDecision -->|Approve| OwnerApprove[Invitation becomes approved]
    OwnerDecision -->|Disapprove| OwnerDisapprove[Invitation becomes disapproved]
    OwnerApprove --> ApprovedUser
    OwnerDisapprove --> NoAccess
    DirectMember --> ApprovedUser
    OwnerManagementPage --> OwnerEditAll[Can edit all buildings under own organisation]

    AdminCheck -->|Yes| SiteAdminPage[Site admin console]
    SiteAdminPage --> SiteAdminAllOrgs[Can access all organisations]
    SiteAdminPage --> SiteAdminEditAll[Can edit all buildings in all organisations]
    SiteAdminPage --> SiteAdminCreateAny[Can create buildings with no restrictions]
    SiteAdminPage --> SiteAdminManageAll[Can manage users and invitations across organisations]

    subgraph AccessRules[Final building access rules]
        Rule1[Approved regular user: create building + edit own buildings only]
        Rule2[Organisation owner: edit all buildings in their organisation]
        Rule3[Site admin: create and edit all buildings across all organisations]
    end

    UserCreate --> Rule1
    UserEditOwn --> Rule1
    OwnerEditAll --> Rule2
    SiteAdminEditAll --> Rule3
    SiteAdminCreateAny --> Rule3

